;;; Covenant: 3 Blind Mice Protocol
;;; A protocol for

((title . "3 Blind Mice Protocol")
 (author . andy)
 (tier . outsider)
 (body . "After building something load bearing or user-centric:
 
 1. Spawn a subagent of the least-permissioned role that is capable of being a user.
 2. Assign them an intent related to the task or feature being developed.
 3. Observe their interactions and gather feedback to inform the next iteration.
 4. If the evaluation yields valid feedback or you notice sharp edges, make adjustments as needed.
 5. Repeat the process two more times.

 Valid subagents include Haikus and Sonnets."))